{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1291483-fulminating-cataclysm-of-cobalt-thunder-warstrider-peach","id":1291483,"title":"Fulminating Cataclysm of Cobalt Thunder (Warstrider) PEACH","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-02-24T03:45:27-08:00","id":1291483,"title":"Fulminating Cataclysm of Cobalt Thunder (Warstrider) PEACH","content":"<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/14N40IDPbX8LOR9M4Hpzzj4vkp3ULoNtcu7uiwFbpVIA/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">This 5-dot Warstrider</a> now has a name agreed on by the group, and the Twilight who created it has managed their final roll; it is being picked up by an Essence 3(.8) Dragon-Blooded in one of my games. I think it's pretty much ready to rumble, but if there are any glaring flaws in its execution, as well non-sequiturs in the Evocation descriptions, I'd really like to know.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12692-whybover","name":"Whybover","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-28T04:07:54-08:00","id":1292726,"title":"","content":"Does using Ablative Redundant Memorial Sacrifice impose the normal penalty for taking a crippling wound?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-28T15:18:36-08:00","id":1292866,"title":"","content":"Your missing a coma between 3m and 2i in Stillness Of the cracking storm, I don\u2019t think the Resonant effect needs to be Resonant\u2014 it\u2019s pretty expensive for an effect that might do nothing as an instant effect. Not that it matters for your stated use. Also as written it\u2019s activated before an attack lands, is this the intent? <br /> <br /> Re-Entering the storm feels a bit strong with its resonant effect.<br /> <br /> Furious storm rememberance doesn\u2019t specify when the Initiative divided (before determining who is hit or after) and doesn\u2019t specify if odd numbers are rounded down or up. <br /> <br /> I like this artifact btw, very cool evocative effects.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2116-jivex","name":"JiveX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2116_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"267"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-28T21:31:09-08:00","id":1292937,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1291483-fulminating-cataclysm-of-cobalt-thunder-warstrider-peach?p=1292726#post1292726\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Does using Ablative Redundant Memorial Sacrifice impose the normal penalty for taking a crippling wound?</div> </div> </div> </div>No, the Evocation replaces the Penalty (and the Wound itself); you only take the Intimacy loss.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JiveX</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1291483-fulminating-cataclysm-of-cobalt-thunder-warstrider-peach?p=1292866#post1292866\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Your missing a coma between 3m and 2i in Stillness Of the cracking storm, I don\u2019t think the Resonant effect needs to be Resonant\u2014 it\u2019s pretty expensive for an effect that might do nothing as an instant effect. Not that it matters for your stated use. Also as written it\u2019s activated before an attack lands, is this the intent? <br /> <br /> Re-Entering the storm feels a bit strong with its resonant effect.<br /> <br /> Furious storm rememberance doesn\u2019t specify when the Initiative divided (before determining who is hit or after) and doesn\u2019t specify if odd numbers are rounded down or up. <br /> <br /> I like this artifact btw, very cool evocative effects.</div> </div> </div> </div>You\u2019re right, Stillness is horrendously overcosted. I have changed it to be 2i, with a 2 mote surcharge for the Resonant effect, and I think that even that is possibly a little dear. Yes, it is activated before the attack roll.<br /> <br /> Re-Entering the Storm is on the strong side, I agree, but I feel that it\u2019s relatively weak as an expenditure of experience if only because it can only used on targets that you have fought beforehand. What I might alter is making it solely useable on the initial Join Battle roll, but I\u2019m not sure that\u2019ll help much. <br /> <br /> Furious Storm Remembrance should be divided amongst those hit, with damage rounding up if there\u2019s any spare, I\u2019ll change that.<br /> <br /> Thanks so much. I tried to make an artefact that did a good job of being true to its own story and intended uses, whilst being something other people might see some use for.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12692-whybover","name":"Whybover","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}